      "subrace": null,
      "description": "Always late, always checking his pocket watch.",
      "personality": "Perpetually anxious and fussy, obsessed with punctuality.",
      "motivation": "Desperate not to be late for the Duchess and dreading the Queen's temper.",
      "qualities": "Well-dressed, meticulous, easily flustered.",
      "weaknesses": "So absorbed in his own worries that he barely notices Alice at all.",
      "biography": "A White Rabbit who dashes past Alice muttering about being late, and whose disappearance down a hole is what draws her into Wonderland in the first place.",
      "plannedTimeline": "Reappears throughout Wonderland, always in a hurry, never stopping long enough to explain anything.",
