      "qualities": "A commanding presence, never openly questioned by her subjects.",
      "weaknesses": "Her threats are all bark - executions are ordered constantly but never actually carried out.",
      "biography": "The volatile ruler of Wonderland's card kingdom, who hosts a chaotic croquet match and rules her court through fear alone.",
